WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.590
Conversations: every Instagram, WhatsApp and Telegram message in one inbox. Here you read a conversation, reply yourself, approve the assistant's suggestion or hand the conversation to a team member.

2
00:00:15.136 --> 00:00:33.570
At the top of the list, choose the app (all, Instagram, WhatsApp, Telegram) and use the filters to see only unread, waiting for team, mine or assistant. Search covers names, numbers and the text of every conversation (Ctrl+K).

3
00:00:34.122 --> 00:00:44.220
Click a conversation. If the assistant has suggested a reply, the "Assistant's suggestion" card shows three buttons: Send, Edit or No.

4
00:00:44.774 --> 00:00:58.090
To reply by hand, type in the box at the bottom: Enter sends, Shift+Enter starts a new line. "/" opens the quick replies, and the attach button sends a file from the media library.

5
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:08.430
"Take over from assistant" silences the assistant in this conversation so you can carry on yourself; when you are done, click "Return to assistant".

6
00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:18.300
If the customer sent a payment receipt, the receipt card appears right here with "Confirm payment" and "Reject"; confirming also tells the customer.

7
00:01:18.848 --> 00:01:27.750
On WhatsApp, 24 hours after the customer's last message only template messages can be sent; ordinary messages are closed.
